cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Marine Race Arena in your research, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Marine Race Arena"
abstract: >-
  A configurable and reproducible benchmark for developing and evaluating
  autonomous systems in underwater gate-racing tasks, built on HoloOcean with a
  BlueROV2-class vehicle. Controllers operate exclusively from onboard
  observations, acoustic measurements and optional inter-vehicle communication,
  while an independent referee accesses privileged simulator state only to
  validate ordered gate crossings, enforce the rules and compute the official
  results.
